elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133151572,imgsize-70584.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Kobe Bryant: "I have nothing in common with lazy people who blame others for…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161188.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-kobe-bryant-i-have-nothing-in-common-with-lazy-people-who-blame-others-for-a-blunt-lesson-on-accountability-effort-and-refusing-to-make-excuses/articleshow/133161188.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-kobe-bryant-i-have-nothing-in-common-with-lazy-people-who-blame-others-for-a-blunt-lesson-on-accountability-effort-and-refusing-to-make-excuses/articleshow/133161188.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T22:45:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133161475,imgsize-81320.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['I'm their banker': Trump says US controls Iran's frozen assets as he threatens economic or military action]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133160695.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-their-banker-trump-says-us-controls-irans-frozen-assets-as-he-threatens-economic-or-military-action/articleshow/133160695.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-their-banker-trump-says-us-controls-irans-frozen-assets-as-he-threatens-economic-or-military-action/articleshow/133160695.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T22:24:06+05:30</pubDate><d