eechless and emotional reaction to the memo. Their enduring friendship, which began in 2004, made the moment incredibly special.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/relationships/maid-of-honour-plays-brides-old-voice-memo-for-wedding-toast-stunned-bride-says-she-couldnt-believe-it/articleshow/133157750.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/relationships/maid-of-honour-plays-brides-old-voice-memo-for-wedding-toast-stunned-bride-says-she-couldnt-believe-it/articleshow/133157750.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T20:15:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158081,imgsize-242008.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Will NYPD cops go to Syria, Lebanon with Zohran Mamdani's wife? Row over Rama Duwaji's travel plan to meet family]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133156384.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/will-nypd-cops-go-to-syria-lebanon-with-zohran-mamdanis-wife-row-over-rama-duwajis-travel-plan-to-meet-family/articleshow/133156384.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/will-nypd-cops-go-to-syria-lebanon-with-zohran-mamdanis-wife-row-over-rama-duwajis-travel-plan-to-meet-family/articleshow/133156384.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T19:16:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133156495,imgsize-84050.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maryland's first human composting facility offers an alternative to burial and cremation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133156114.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Maryland has introduced an innovative option for end-of-life choices with natural organic reduction. Located in Elkridge, a new facility offers a sustainable alternative to traditional burial and cremation methods. This eco-friendly process converts human remains into nutrient-dense soil in about a month. Families can either keep the soil or contribute it to projects focusing on land conservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marylands-first-human-composting-facility-offers-an-alternative-to-burial-and-cremation-through-natural-organic-reduction/articleshow/133156114.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/marylands-first-human-composting-facility-offers-an-alternative-to-burial-and-cremation-through-natural-organic-reduction/articleshow/133156114.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T19:04:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133156229,imgsize-195890.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Malaysia's Princess Ilyana marries British GT racer Chris Froggatt in Kuala Lumpur]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133152388.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Tengku Puteri Raja Tengku Puteri Ilyana Alia, daughter of Pahang Sultan Al-Sultan Abdullah, married British racing driver Christopher Lionel Froggatt in Kuala Lumpur on August 7. The ceremony was attended by members of the Pahang royal family and followed traditional Islamic wedding customs, including the presentation of ‘mas kahwin’, ring exchange and ‘merenjis’.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/malaysias-princess-ilyana-29-married-british-gt-racer-chris-froggatt-32-the-multi-day-kuala-lumpur-wed